          "text": "Description: On September 7, 2009, around 6:10 - 6:15 PM, a witness observed in the O-SE (east-north-east) sky over Paris a \"bright ball with strong intermittent flashes.\" No other witness statements were collected regarding this phenomenon. Since the witness did not wish to complete a standard observation questionnaire, further investigation is impossible due to the lack of precise information. The case is classified as \"C.\"",
